$t\\mapsto \\gamma (t,q,v)$\">$t\\mapsto \\gamma (t,q,v)$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\in (-\\delta ,\\delta )$\">$t\\in (-\\delta ,\\delta )$</span>, is the unique geodesic passing through <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q$\">$q$</span> with velocity <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v$\">$v$</span> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t=0$\">$t=0$</span>, for each <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q\\in V$\">$q\\in V$</span> and each <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in T_qM$\">$v\\in T_qM$</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$|v|&lt;\\varepsilon _1$\">$|v|&lt;\\varepsilon _1$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-5-equation","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-6-reparam","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-5-exist","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-exist","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-exist"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-5-unique","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-unique","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-unique"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-5-chart-family","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-chart-family","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-chart-family"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-5-metric-family","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-metric-family","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-5-metric-family"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#prop:dc-ch3-2-7","title":"prop:dc-ch3-2-7","label":"prop:dc-ch3-2-7"},{"kind":"uses"